  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nThe regular expression engine of ICU used by Chrome is prone to a heap memory corruption bug when processing certain regular expressions. This bug can be triggered in Chrome via Web SQL Database support, which is backed by SQLite that use ICU's regular expression engine"
